
Produce a value of the following type:
A contact address that is an email address.
- emailAddress (string): The email address, which must contain an at sign.

The following properties MUST hold in your response:
- The email address is not empty.
- The email address must contain an '@' character.
Example valid JSON responses:
{"emailAddress":"ada@example.org"}
{"emailAddress":"alan@example.com"}
